{"id":"n41253-3-7","stage":5,"title":"넘보다 · 小瞧","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n41253-3-7-1","ko":"네가 뭘 안다고 나서니?","zh":"你懂什么啊，也敢站出来说话？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네가","audio":"/audio/3bd2d2d84b2dc14c59a4.mp3"}},{"text":"뭘","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭘","audio":"/audio/441ab920d2baa0d1bea5.mp3"}},{"text":"안다고","meaning":"懂，明白","explanation":"알다：懂，明白；ㄴ다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"9","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안다고","audio":"/audio/bb451716f96c6d949dad.mp3"}},{"text":"나서니?","meaning":"出头，出面，干涉","explanation":"나서다：出头，出面，干涉；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"나서다","audio":"/audio/d8c0446b0a9a131b1db7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61183","senseId":"3","lemma":"나서다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나서니","audio":"/audio/0760f507a67fad238849.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"懂，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"对于对方的某个命令或请求，同意听从。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]},{"id":"d8c0446b0a9a131b","term":"나서다","zh":"出头，出面，干涉","audio":"/audio/d8c0446b0a9a131b1db7.mp3","entryId":"61183","definition":"干预某事。","pronunciation":["나서다"]}],"audio":"/audio/338438dd784fa492e2b0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n41253-3-7-2","ko":"어리다고 저를 함부로 넘보지 마세요.","zh":"别因为年纪小就随便招惹我。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어리다고","meaning":"年幼、年龄小","explanation":"어리다：年幼、年龄小；다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"어리다","audio":"/audio/ec54bee5939613d498c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74176","senseId":"1","lemma":"어리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어리다고","audio":"/audio/517c1a765656400c5898.mp3"}},{"text":"저를","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저를","audio":"/audio/da4de346f30de5013b78.mp3"}},{"text":"함부로","meaning":"随意，随便，乱，大肆，恣意","explanation":"함부로：随意，随便，乱，大肆，恣意。","readings":[{"term":"함부로","audio":"/audio/a57ea17b4197d3729e38.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72466","senseId":"1","lemma":"함부로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"함부로","audio":"/audio/a57ea17b4197d3729e38.mp3"}},{"text":"넘보지","meaning":"小瞧，轻视","explanation":"넘보다：小瞧，轻视；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"넘보다","audio":"/audio/05709177e9ceeb02c6b6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41253","senseId":"3","lemma":"넘보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넘보지","audio":"/audio/d325ad3edff33dde55ec.mp3"}},{"text":"마세요.","meaning":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","explanation":"말다：不要做、停止做（-지 말다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69296","senseId":"2","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마세요","audio":"/audio/0a355a328a450c9b0583.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ec54bee5939613d4","term":"어리다","zh":"年幼、年龄小","audio":"/audio/ec54bee5939613d498c9.mp3","entryId":"74176","definition":"年纪小。","pronunciation":["어리다"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"a57ea17b4197d372","term":"함부로","zh":"随意，随便，乱，大肆，恣意","audio":"/audio/a57ea17b4197d3729e38.mp3","entryId":"72466","definition":"不小心或不假思索而胡乱地。","pronunciation":["함부로"]},{"id":"05709177e9ceeb02","term":"넘보다","zh":"小瞧，轻视","audio":"/audio/05709177e9ceeb02c6b6.mp3","entryId":"41253","definition":"瞧不起或小看别人的能力。","pronunciation":["넘ː보다"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"69296","definition":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","pronunciation":["말ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/bcc48f17489a6de5799a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.911,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=41253","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"고급","day":176,"sequenceScore":4.0377,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["别因为年纪小就随便招惹我。","你懂什么啊，也敢站出来说话？","我听说这家餐厅有针对老年人的优惠呢。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你懂什么啊，也敢站出来说话？","我听说这家餐厅有针对老年人的优惠呢。","别因为年纪小就随便招惹我。"],"answer":2}]}
